[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823264807","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823264807","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823264807,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j4mQn","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T11:39:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T11:39:44Z","body":"ATS threw me down a rabbit hole to remove unnecessary includes from the GLES3 files, which I pushed as a separate commit, as this one requires thorougher review.\r\n\r\nWhile at it, I found a few things that could maybe be improved further:\r\n- `rasterizer_gles3.h` basically includes everything from `drivers/gles3/` as it has it all as member variables. But in turn it's included in many of the other files just to check `is_gles_over_gl()`. Maybe we can move this utility somewhere else that doesn't include the whole world? It makes it hard to ensure that files only include what they need when most of them include everything.\r\n- `rasterizer_canvas_gles3.h` and `rasterizer_scene_gles3.h` include some `storage` files, or even directly shaders, mostly to use some enums from them. Maybe those enums could be moved to separate files with less cross-dependencies so we keep most bigger files in the .cpp.\r\n- Likewise, there's a bunch of dependencies on `rendering_server.h` just for some enums. Splitting those to some `rendering_server_enums.h` could likely decouple things quite a bit (notably avoid including `display_server.h`, `variant.h`, etc...). FYI @Ivorforce ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823264807/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823275438","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823275438","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823275438,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j4o2u","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T11:42:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:11:04Z","body":"Interesting build error on MSVC, sounds like shuffling some `core` includes in `drivers/gles3/storage/config.{cpp,h}` make `Object` fail ~because it's no longer including `typedefs.h` early enough~ (using `ConnectFlags` from `windows.h` instead of its own)... ~Should `object.h` include `typedefs.h`?~\r\n\r\n*Edit:* Seems like we don't `#undef` `ConnectFlags` in `typedefs.h` (anymore?) so it's probably just a `windows.h` include order change issue.\r\n\r\nYeah we include `platform_gl.h` in `config.h` for `GL` int types, which pulls in `windows.h` via GLAD, and since I moved `core/config/project_settings.h` to `config.cpp`, it's now too late. I f'ing hate `windows.h`...","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823275438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823422163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823422163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823422163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j5MrT","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:15:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:15:15Z","body":"> Yeah we include `platform_gl.h` in `config.h` for `GL` int types, which pulls in `windows.h` via GLAD, and since I moved `core/config/project_settings.h` to `config.cpp`, it's now too late. I f'ing hate `windows.h`...\r\n\r\n@bruvzg I wonder if we should split `platform_gl.h` into `platform_gl.h` and `platform_egl.h`, so we only include `egl.h` (which includes `EGLplatform.h` and a bunch of platform specific headers) where we really need it, and not in GLES3 implementation headers that just need `GLuint`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823422163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823485611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823485611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823485611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j5cKr","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:23:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:23:46Z","body":"> I wonder if we should split platform_gl.h into platform_gl.h and platform_egl.h, so we only include egl.h (which includes EGLplatform.h and a bunch of platform specific headers) where we really need it, and not in GLES3 implementation headers that just need GLuint.\r\n\r\nI will check it on Monday. On Windows and macOS we need both desktop OpenGL native GL and GLES for ANGLE support, so header setup is likely pretty convoluted to handle this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823485611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823518955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823518955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823518955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j5kTr","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:28:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T13:37:14Z","body":"I added a commit to split EGL includes to `platform_egl.h` for Windows, macOS and Linux (*Edit:* and Android).\r\n~It's also removing the EGL includes for Android which I'm not sure are used (at least not via `gl_context`), but that will need double checking.~\r\n*Edit:* Android does need EGL for some debug callback in `rasterizer_gles3.cpp` and some custom stuff in `config.cpp`.\r\n\r\nWindows (mingw) and Linux seem to compile fine locally. Didn't test ANGLE and macOS.\r\n\r\n*Edit 2:* Moved to #115632.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823518955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823593308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823593308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823593308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j52dc","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:48:13Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:48:13Z","body":"> there's a bunch of dependencies on rendering_server.h just for some enums. Splitting those to some rendering_server_enums.h could likely decouple things quite a bit (notably avoid including display_server.h, variant.h, etc...). FYI @Ivorforce\r\n\r\nI've been eyeing `rendering_server.h` as well, especially since it comes in second place in my tracker https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111218.\r\nI've had a go at it but it turned out quite complicated, because there's a lot of enums that would need to be moved. I think the rendering team would be better suited to find a good solution.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823593308/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823614752","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3823614752","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3823614752,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j57sg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T12:54:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T12:54:21Z","body":"I'll move the EGL split to a separate PR and just avoid moving `project_settings.h` to `config.cpp` for now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3823614752/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824140567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3824140567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3824140567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j78EX","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T14:47:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T14:58:31Z","body":"> `rasterizer_gles3.h` basically includes everything from `drivers/gles3/` as it has it all as member variables. But in turn it's included in many of the other files just to check `is_gles_over_gl()`. Maybe we can move this utility somewhere else that doesn't include the whole world? It makes it hard to ensure that files only include what they need when most of them include everything.\r\n\r\nI gave this a try with the last commit, seems to work on Linux.\r\n\r\nSuggestions welcome on the name, currently went with `RasterizerUtilGLES3`.\r\n\r\n`rasterizer_gles3.h` is now almost only used where it should be (platform `OS` and `DisplayServer`, and `rasterizer_gles.cpp`).\r\n\r\nThere's one remaining dependency in `drivers/gles3/storage/material_storage.cpp` to check for `is_xr_enabled()`, but that's an abstraction in `RenderingCompositor` so I didn't touch that one (though it's probably also once that would have been nice to have somewhere else).\r\n\r\nAnd there's one use in `drivers/egl/egl_manager.cpp` for ` RasterizerGLES3::set_screen_flipped_y` on Windows, this could also be moved to `RasterizerUtilGLES3` if wanted.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824140567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824208330","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115623#issuecomment-3824208330","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115623","id":3824208330,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j8MnK","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T15:02:52Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:02:52Z","body":"I think I'm done refactoring `drivers/gles3` for now, this can be reviewed :sweat_smile: ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824208330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]